{"research_date": "2026-09-10", "pairs": [{"pair_id": "conflict_324b563bce4d84fe26d4699f", "claim_ids": ["claim_853abe770c7fc6fd55f849c0", "claim_9d39200c1a656429bbf99301"], "query_ids": ["q_319"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_853abe770c7fc6fd55f849c0", "quote": "Likewise, in HQ 955037 (1994) concerning the classification of an electric actuator, Customs explained that an electric motor is classifiable under heading 8501, HTSUS, even when imported with additional components other than those listed in EN 85.01 if:", "url": "https://rulings.cbp.gov/ruling/N322256", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"legal_authority": "HQ 955037 (1994)", "hts_code": "heading 8501, HTSUS"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_9d39200c1a656429bbf99301", "quote": "In longstanding precedence, CBP concluded the intent of EN 85.01 as electric motors having additional components that merely complement the function of the motor were intended to remain classifiable in heading 8501.", "url": "https://rulings.cbp.gov/ruling/N322256", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"tariff_program": "EN 85.01", "hts_code": "heading 8501"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_da49d45a433ca6767d6472af", "claim_ids": ["claim_9c46088dab5ec0a4dcf45013", "claim_9e51275190bb6fe98f671ed0"], "query_ids": ["q_319"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_9c46088dab5ec0a4dcf45013", "quote": "The Electrical Drive Units under consideration each consist of an electric motor, inverter, a gear box, drive shaft, etc.", "url": "https://rulings.cbp.gov/ruling/N322256", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {}}, {"claim_id": "claim_9e51275190bb6fe98f671ed0", "quote": "As such, we are of the opinion that the Electrical Drive Units under consideration here are AC motors because that is the type of electricity that [...]", "url": "https://rulings.cbp.gov/ruling/N322256", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_205b5718ebbb6329041d579e", "claim_ids": ["claim_9d39200c1a656429bbf99301", "claim_b6b7c70e50fd11feebae6d73"], "query_ids": ["q_319"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_9d39200c1a656429bbf99301", "quote": "In longstanding precedence, CBP concluded the intent of EN 85.01 as electric motors having additional components that merely complement the function of the motor were intended to remain classifiable in heading 8501.", "url": "https://rulings.cbp.gov/ruling/N322256", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"tariff_program": "EN 85.01", "hts_code": "heading 8501"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_b6b7c70e50fd11feebae6d73", "quote": "In HQ 086832 (1990) Customs stated, “a motor remains a motor for tariff purposes despite having other articles attached to it” while noting that “[t]hese other articles can be quite substantial.”", "url": "https://rulings.cbp.gov/ruling/N322256", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"legal_authority": "HQ 086832 (1990)"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_70229faab690f715b9e43450", "claim_ids": ["claim_a81b542b05fc740703092afe", "claim_e316ef34e56c4eb4898823aa"], "query_ids": ["q_319"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_a81b542b05fc740703092afe", "quote": "Pursuant to U.S. Note 20 to Subchapter III, Chapter 99, HTSUS, products of China classified under subheading 8501.53.40, HTSUS, unless specifically excluded, are subject to an additional 25 percent ad valorem rate of duty.", "url": "https://www.customsmobile.com/rulings/docview?doc_id=HQ+H329719&highlight=8501.53%2A", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "U.S. Note 20 to Subchapter III, Chapter 99, HTSUS", "country_of_origin": "China", "duty_rate": "25 percent ad valorem"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_e316ef34e56c4eb4898823aa", "quote": "At the time of importation, you must report the Chapter 99 subheading, i.e., 9903.88.01, in addition to subheading 8501.53.40, HTSUS, listed above.", "url": "https://www.customsmobile.com/rulings/docview?doc_id=HQ+H329719&highlight=8501.53%2A", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"chapter_99_code": "9903.88.01"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_6588a99fd520004dccd66bf3", "claim_ids": ["claim_136e500cc705311c3955288d", "claim_41cd440699495d6451ea2f47"], "query_ids": ["q_320"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_136e500cc705311c3955288d", "quote": "Trump's auto tariffs are expected to exclude only the value of content made in the United States.", "url": "https://www.govtech.com/transportation/will-tariffs-upend-electric-vehicle-adoption-in-the-u-s", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Trump's auto tariffs"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_41cd440699495d6451ea2f47", "quote": "Imports under the US-Mexico-Canada Agreement can certify their US content; the tariffs will only apply to the value of the non-US content", "url": "https://blog.greenenergyconsumers.org/blog/what-the-car-tariffs-mean-for-electric-vehicles", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_c4e9f22da1e514ef87a3b7c7", "claim_ids": ["claim_2c0631f960f2669cb7c16a3d", "claim_daae00d66d437b0bdc56c9d7"], "query_ids": ["q_320"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_2c0631f960f2669cb7c16a3d", "quote": "The Section 232 tariffs on steel, aluminum, and copper are unchanged at 50 percent.", "url": "https://www.geartechnology.com/after-the-ruling", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 232", "duty_rate": "50 percent"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_daae00d66d437b0bdc56c9d7", "quote": "Trump is citing national security concerns for the Section 232 tariffs grounded in the Trade Expansion Act, saying the United States needs a robust manufacturing base and supply chain.", "url": "https://www.govtech.com/transportation/will-tariffs-upend-electric-vehicle-adoption-in-the-u-s", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"legal_authority": "Section 232 tariffs grounded in the Trade Expansion Act", "duty_rate": "25%"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_3337b688f4d6f3033c22933d", "claim_ids": ["claim_3941441be626eb7b32fdcdfd", "claim_fa85d5046586f4e48245fe96"], "query_ids": ["q_320"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_3941441be626eb7b32fdcdfd", "quote": "The decision invalidated the sweeping “reciprocal” tariffs on nearly every U.S. trading partner, along with the fentanyl-related tariffs on China, Canada, and Mexico.", "url": "https://www.geartechnology.com/after-the-ruling", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {}}, {"claim_id": "claim_fa85d5046586f4e48245fe96", "quote": "On March 26, 2025, President Trump announced 25% tariffs on imports of both cars and car parts", "url": "https://blog.greenenergyconsumers.org/blog/what-the-car-tariffs-mean-for-electric-vehicles", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "25% tariffs on imports of both cars and car parts", "announcement_date": "March 26, 2025"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_104962a0b96c50834c573cb5", "claim_ids": ["claim_d9abae9827d07d6c7251af97", "claim_f03e261b7b613d72c178cfe7"], "query_ids": ["q_320"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_d9abae9827d07d6c7251af97", "quote": "Raw steel—billet, bar, rod, forging stock—and products classified in HTS Chapters 72 and 73 are assessed on total value.", "url": "https://www.geartechnology.com/after-the-ruling", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"affected_product": "billet, bar, rod, forging stock", "hts_code": "HTS Chapters 72 and 73"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_f03e261b7b613d72c178cfe7", "quote": "For derivative products classified outside those chapters, the tariff applies only to the steel or aluminum content", "url": "https://www.geartechnology.com/after-the-ruling", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_1c5d0757072aa9cc87be7f8b", "claim_ids": ["claim_2cda86cf2c6dd6b2099719aa", "claim_2f50e6950b199fc376a31b14"], "query_ids": ["q_320"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_2cda86cf2c6dd6b2099719aa", "quote": "General Motors Co., which sells the second-most electric vehicles in the United States behind Tesla Inc., saw EV sales nearly double year-over-year in the first three months of 2025. However, it imports the Chevrolet Equinox EV, which starts at $33,600, along with the Blazer EV and Cadillac Optiq, from Mexico.", "url": "https://www.govtech.com/transportation/will-tariffs-upend-electric-vehicle-adoption-in-the-u-s", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"company": "General Motors Co."}}, {"claim_id": "claim_2f50e6950b199fc376a31b14", "quote": "Ford Motor Co.'s Mustang Mach-E also originates in Mexico, and it imports the hybrid Lincoln Nautilus from China.", "url": "https://www.govtech.com/transportation/will-tariffs-upend-electric-vehicle-adoption-in-the-u-s", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"company": "Ford Motor Co.", "exporting_country": "Mexico"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_dc64d3cedcfb850808c68495", "claim_ids": ["claim_124138c0ee9c8a105a1e8f25", "claim_1368ab8f4c302cce55438c98"], "query_ids": ["q_321"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_124138c0ee9c8a105a1e8f25", "quote": "8708504110—DRIVE AXLES WITH DIFFERNTL FOR VEHICLES,NESOI", "url": "https://www.trade.gov/automotive-parts-tariff-codes", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"affected_product": "DRIVE AXLES WITH DIFFERNTL FOR VEHICLES,NESOI", "hts_code": "8708504110"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_1368ab8f4c302cce55438c98", "quote": "- 8708504110 8708504110—DRIVE AXLES WITH DIFFERNTL FOR VEHICLES,NESOI", "url": "https://www.trade.gov/automotive-parts-tariff-codes", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"affected_product": "DRIVE AXLES WITH DIFFERNTL FOR VEHICLES,NESOI", "hts_code": "8708504110"}}]}]}

